  <History Date="30-01-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added compatibility for 50 DMX mode R20 export.  Added product thumbnail." />
  <History Date="09-04-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Split for Capture and added Atlabase ID's to supported modes.  Revised product thumbnail." />
  <History Date="09-04-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added split patch options for 14, 26 and 50 DMX modes." />
  <History Date="16-04-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's for 14/26/50 DMX split part modes and revised 24/192 DMX single strip ID." />
